#: ../developer/deployment.md:3
msgid ""
"Running HybridInference as a long-lived deployment: what starts, how to "
"operate it, and how to reset it without losing (or accidentally keeping) "
"data."
msgstr ""
"把 HybridInference 作为长期运行的部署来跑：会启动些什么、怎么运维，以及"
"怎样在不丢数据（也不会意外留下数据）的前提下重置它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:6
msgid ""
"First-time setup — cloning, filling in `.env`, and the first `make up` — "
"is in [Installation](installation.md#quick-start-with-docker). This page "
"assumes the stack already comes up."
msgstr ""
"首次搭建——克隆仓库、填写 `.env`、第一次 `make up`——见[安装"
"](installation.md#quick-start-with-docker)。本"
"页假定整套服务栈已经能起来。"

